<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $15.5 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $15.5 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said it placed overnight repurchase agreements for $15.5 million Friday.</p>
<p>The loans to local banks were set at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight interest rates rose to 5.6 percent from 5.55 percent Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar eased to 0.99953 pesos from 0.99985 at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
